# source/cmach/extern.inc is a generated file (tools/extgen/gencexec.py) but is
# committed like the genpexec Pascal outputs (source/*/extexec.pas), so a clean
# checkout builds cmach without running the generator.

# Products are committed only in the hosts tree (hosts/<host>/<arch>/<bits>);
# the working copies in bin and libs are restored from it by configure
# (mandatory after checkout) and rebuilt by the build scripts. Scripts,
# module headers (.pas) and the portable intermediates (.p6) stay tracked.
